# The four-point certificate, and the unconditional bound it discharges

`four_point_cert` proves the hypothesis `hCert` of `Zeta23Ext.Bridge.n_point_bound` at
`n = 4`, `c = 2310/10⁶`, `p = 2500`, so that the `n = 4` instance of that theorem is
**unconditional**.  Generated by `hunts/ainta_seven_point/four_point_gen.py`; see
`hunts/ainta_seven_point/FOUR-POINT.md`.
-/

noncomputable section
