-- `eventually_atTop` in `Filter`: the same opens `lean/bridge/Zeta23Ext/Bridge/Main.lean`
-- uses.  `autoImplicit` is off in the lakefile, so a missing one is an error rather than
-- a silent auto-bound variable.
open Filter
